    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\n<div>\n    <table class=\"grid dict\">\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Id: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.02</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Url: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><a href=\"PlanDefinition-MEASLES.DT.02.html\">MEASLES.DT.02 Screen before measles vaccination</a></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Version: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">0.1.0</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Title: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">MEASLES.DT.02 Screen before measles vaccination</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Status: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">draft</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Experimental: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">true</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Type: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                \n                    \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>system: </b> <span><a href=\"http://terminology.hl7.org/7.5.0/CodeSystem-plan-definition-type.html\">http://terminology.hl7.org/CodeSystem/plan-definition-type</a></span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                        <p style=\"margin-bottom: 5px;\">\n                            <b>code: </b> <span>eca-rule</span>\n                        </p>\n                        \n                        \n                    \n                \n                \n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Date: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">2026-11-23 10:30:20+0000</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Publisher: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">WHO</td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Description: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\"><div><p>Whether to vaccinate today, defer, or not vaccinate. Hit policy FIRST. A mild concurrent infection is not a reason to defer. Adjudication: pending. L3 of input/decision-logic/MEASLES.DT.02.dmn.</p>\n</div></td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Libraries: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><a href=\"Library-MEASLESDT02.html\">MEASLES.DT.02 Screen before measles vaccination (logic)</a></td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n\n        \n        <tr>\n            <th scope=\"row\"><b>Actions: </b></th>\n            <td style=\"padding-left: 4px;\">\n                <table class=\"grid-dict\">\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 1: do-not-vaccinate:</b> History of anaphylaxis or severe allergy to a component (e.g. neomycin, gelatin).\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 1 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 2: do-not-vaccinate:</b> Severe immunosuppression.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 2 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 3: defer:</b> Pregnant: vaccinate after the pregnancy.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 3 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 4: defer:</b> Another live vaccine less than 4 weeks ago: give on the same day or wait until 4 weeks have passed.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 4 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 5: proceed:</b> No contraindication; a mild concurrent infection does not count.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 5 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                    <tr>\n                        <td>\n                            \n                            <b> Rule 6: unknown:</b> Not settled: ask about allergy, immunosuppression and pregnancy.\n                            \n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            <b>If:</b>\n                            \n                            <i>Applicability:</i>\n                            \n                            <i>(Rule 6 fires)</i>\n                            <br/>\n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                            \n                        </td>\n                    </tr>\n                    \n                </table>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n        \n    </table>\n</div>\n</div>"
